        "https://ricetoday.irri.org/rice-domestication/",
        "https://herbaria.plants.ox.ac.uk/bol/plants400/Profiles/OP/Oryza"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Rice cultivation has involved reshaping steep hillsides into terraces and building systems to channel water into fields.",
